  "result": "**PASS** for T4. I wrote `.loop/tmp/verdict.json`.\n\n`vloop task validate` covers every acceptance criterion:\n- **Output:** the exact problem and warning wording, the closing `plan ok` or `<n> problem(s)` line, and exit 1 only on a problem.\n- **Cycles:** each cycle is reported as the loop itself, starting from its lowest id.\n- **Areas:** the area rules run only when `areas` is set.\n- **Read-only:** `Check` never writes to the plan.\n- **Tests and fixtures:** `internal/state/testdata/validate/` has a passing `good.json` plus one firing fixture per rule. Both the state and cli tests exercise them, and the cli tests include the `TestTaskValidate*` set.\n- **Paths and `.loop/`:** the new files contain no `/Users` paths and don't touch `.loop/`, `.claude/` or the home directory.\n\nI relied on the driver's gate run for the gofmt, vet, tidy and cross-build criteria. I did not re-run the tests myself.",
